{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029C30","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"这里流的是Río del Jade，意思是“翡翠之河”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":"JPN_JADE_RENDERING_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"翡翠？这里有矿床吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不是，只是河面的颜色很像而已。能出产翡翠的是危地马拉。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":"AUX_GUATEMALA_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"可看起来……实在称不上漂亮的颜色。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"现在是雨季，水才这么浑。很快就到旱季了，到时候应该会清澈些。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"AUX_DRY_SEASON_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"这一带河流也是重要的运输路线。水流平缓，沿海还有很多运河。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"船吗……看来稍大些的货物也能运。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"核武器……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":"AUX_LIKE_ADDITION_REMOVED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"具体情况还不清楚。继续调查吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"JPN_COLLECTIVE_INVESTIGATION_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"谢谢。拜托你了，Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":32,"review_flag":"AUX_REQUEST_RESTORED"}]}